==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From *''pene''. Cognates include ''[[penikka]]'', Estonian ''[[#Estonian|peni]]'' and Northern Sami ''[[beana]]''.

===Noun===
{{fi-noun|type=tuoli}}

#{{context|archaic|lang=fi}} [[dog]]

====Usage note====
Although no longer used in modern Finnish, the word remains as a popular dog's name.

